//! # {{project.rust.cratePrefix}}-application
//!
//! Application layer for {{project.name}}.
//! Contains commands, use-case handlers, port traits, and orchestration services.
//!
//! ## Design Rules
//!
//! - Depends on the domain crate. Does **not** depend on infrastructure.
//! - Ports (traits) define what the application needs; infrastructure implements them.
//! - Commands are simple structs that represent user intent.
//! - Handlers execute use cases by coordinating domain logic and port calls.
//!
//! ## Module Structure
//!
//! ```text
//! src/
//! ├── commands/      ← Command structs and handlers
//! ├── ports/          ← Trait definitions for infrastructure contracts
//! ├── services/       ← Application services (orchestration)
//! ├── errors.rs       ← Application error types
//! └── lib.rs          ← Public API
//! ```

pub mod commands;
pub mod errors;
pub mod ports;
pub mod services;
